#: accounts/access.py:69
#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s's access is suspended."
msgstr "L'accès de %(name)s est suspendu."

#: accounts/access.py:78
#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s's access is reinstated."
msgstr "L'accès de %(name)s est rétabli."

#: accounts/access.py:104
#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s's access is revoked."
msgstr "L'accès de %(name)s est révoqué."

#: accounts/admission.py:33
msgid "How their registration with the bar was verified"
msgstr "Comment son inscription au barreau a été vérifiée"

#: accounts/admission.py:34
msgid "Who vouched for them"
msgstr "Qui assure son parrainage"

#: accounts/admission.py:37
msgid ""
"Through the bar directory's contact details, never those the person gave."
msgstr ""
"Par les coordonnées de l'annuaire du barreau, jamais celles données par la "
"personne."

#: accounts/admission.py:38
msgid "A trusted defence organisation or an admitted lawyer."
msgstr "Une organisation de défense de confiance, ou un·e avocat·e admis·e."

#: accounts/admission.py:44 keys/forms.py:95
msgid ""
"I compared this safety number with them, through the bar directory's contact "
"details."
msgstr ""
"J'ai comparé ce numéro de sécurité avec la personne, en la contactant par "
"les coordonnées de l'annuaire du barreau."

#: accounts/admission.py:100
msgid ""
"They can be admitted once they have set their password, two-factor "
"authentication and personal key."
msgstr ""
"La personne pourra être admise une fois son mot de passe, sa double "
"authentification et sa clé personnelle mis en place."

#: accounts/admission.py:103 keys/views.py:273
msgid ""
"They have made a new key since this page was shown. Compare its safety "
"number with them again."
msgstr ""
"La personne a créé une nouvelle clé depuis l'affichage de cette page. "
"Comparez à nouveau son numéro de sécurité avec elle."

#: accounts/admission.py:108
#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s is admitted."
msgstr "%(name)s est admis·e."

#: accounts/invitations.py:38
msgid "Email address"
msgstr "Adresse e-mail"

#: accounts/invitations.py:38
msgid "The person's own professional address."
msgstr "L'adresse professionnelle de la personne elle-même."

#: accounts/invitations.py:40
msgid "First name"
msgstr "Prénom"

#: accounts/invitations.py:41
msgid "Last name"
msgstr "Nom"

#: accounts/invitations.py:42
msgid "Bar"
msgstr "Barreau"

#: accounts/invitations.py:50 accounts/invitations.py:85
msgid "An account already uses this address."
msgstr "Un compte utilise déjà cette adresse."

#: accounts/invitations.py:59
msgid "Invite this address anyway"
msgstr "Inviter quand même cette adresse"

#: accounts/invitations.py:62
msgid ""
"This address belonged to a lawyer whose access was revoked. Tick the box to "
"invite it again, as a new applicant who needs verifying and a vouch like "
"anyone else."
msgstr ""
"Cette adresse appartenait à un·e avocat·e à l'accès révoqué. Cochez la case "
"pour l'inviter de nouveau, comme nouvelle candidature, à vérifier et à "
"parrainer comme toute autre."

#: accounts/invitations.py:93
#, python-format
msgid "An invitation link went to %(email)s."
msgstr "Un lien d'invitation a été envoyé à %(email)s."

#: accounts/invitations.py:123
msgid "Your invitation to the footage archive"
msgstr "Votre invitation à l'archive de vidéos"

#: accounts/models.py:71
msgid "email address"
msgstr "adresse e-mail"

#: accounts/models.py:123 accounts/templates/accounts/applicant_review.html:4
msgid "Applicant"
msgstr "Candidat·e"

#: accounts/models.py:124
msgid "Declined applicant"
msgstr "Candidat·e non retenu·e"

#: accounts/models.py:126
msgid "Lawyer"
msgstr "Avocat·e"

#: accounts/models.py:127
msgid "Suspended lawyer"
msgstr "Avocat·e à l'accès suspendu"

#: accounts/models.py:128
msgid "Revoked lawyer"
msgstr "Avocat·e à l'accès révoqué"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/accept_invitation.html:4
#: accounts/templates/accounts/accept_invitation.html:9
msgid "Set your password"
msgstr "Définissez votre mot de passe"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/accept_invitation.html:10
msgid "Next, you will set up two-factor authentication."
msgstr "Ensuite, vous activerez la double authentification."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/accept_invitation.html:14
msgid "Set the password"
msgstr "Enregistrer le mot de passe"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/accept_invitation.html:17
msgid "This link no longer works"
msgstr "Ce lien ne fonctionne plus"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/accept_invitation.html:18
msgid ""
"It has been used already, has expired, or a newer link was sent. Ask the "
"admin for a new one."
msgstr ""
"Il a déjà servi, il a expiré, ou un lien plus récent a été envoyé. Demandez-"
"en un nouveau à l'administrateur·rice."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant.html:4
#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant.html:7
msgid "Waiting for admission"
msgstr "En attente d'admission"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant.html:8
msgid ""
"Your account is ready, but the admin has not admitted you yet. Until then, "
"the archive shows you nothing."
msgstr ""
"Votre compte est prêt, mais l'administrateur·rice ne vous a pas encore "
"admis·e. D'ici là, l'archive ne vous montre rien."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant.html:10
msgid "Your personal key and its safety number"
msgstr "Votre clé personnelle et son numéro de sécurité"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant.html:12
msgid "Before you can be admitted, set up your personal key."
msgstr "Avant de pouvoir être admis·e, créez votre clé personnelle."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant.html:12
#: keys/templates/keys/setup.html:4 keys/templates/keys/setup.html:14
msgid "Set up your personal key"
msgstr "Créer votre clé personnelle"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant_review.html:8
#: keys/templates/keys/confirm_key.html:9
msgid "Bar:"
msgstr "Barreau :"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant_review.html:9
msgid "Email address:"
msgstr "Adresse e-mail :"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant_review.html:11
msgid ""
"They have set their password, two-factor authentication and personal key."
msgstr ""
"La personne a défini son mot de passe, activé la double authentification et "
"créé sa clé personnelle."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant_review.html:11
msgid ""
"They have not yet set their password, two-factor authentication and personal "
"key: they cannot be admitted before then."
msgstr ""
"La personne n'a pas encore défini son mot de passe, activé la double "
"authentification et créé sa clé personnelle : elle ne peut pas être admise "
"avant."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant_review.html:13
msgid "Safety number of their key:"
msgstr "Numéro de sécurité de sa clé :"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant_review.html:14
msgid ""
"Before admitting them, contact them through the bar directory's contact "
"details, never those they gave, and ask them to read the safety number shown "
"on their key page. Admit them only if it is the same as this one."
msgstr ""
"Avant d'admettre la personne, contactez-la par les coordonnées de l'annuaire "
"du barreau, jamais par celles qu'elle a données, et demandez-lui de lire le "
"numéro de sécurité affiché sur sa page de clé. Ne l'admettez que s'il est "
"identique à celui-ci."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant_review.html:17
msgid "Admit"
msgstr "Admettre"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant_review.html:18
msgid ""
"Admit them only once their registration with the bar is verified and someone "
"has vouched for them."
msgstr ""
"N'admettez la personne qu'une fois son inscription au barreau vérifiée et "
"son parrainage obtenu."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant_review.html:22
msgid "Admit as a lawyer"
msgstr "Admettre comme avocat·e"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant_review.html:25
#: accounts/templates/accounts/decline.html:12
msgid "Decline"
msgstr "Ne pas retenir"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant_review.html:26
#: accounts/templates/accounts/decline.html:4
#: accounts/templates/accounts/decline.html:7
msgid "Decline this applicant"
msgstr "Ne pas retenir cette candidature"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/decline.html:8
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(name)s will no longer be able to log in. Their name, bar and email address "
"will be erased. This cannot be undone; they can be invited again later as a "
"new applicant."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s ne pourra plus se connecter. Son nom, son barreau et son adresse e-"
"mail seront effacés. C'est définitif ; la personne pourra plus tard être "
"invitée de nouveau, comme nouveau·elle candidat·e."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/decline.html:11
msgid "I confirm"
msgstr "Je confirme"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/invitation_email.txt:1
msgid ""
"You have been invited to the footage archive for defence lawyers.\n"
"\n"
"Set your password here:"
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes invité·e à rejoindre l'archive de vidéos pour les avocat·es de la "
"défense.\n"
"\n"
"Définissez votre mot de passe ici :"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/invitation_email.txt:7
#, python-format
msgid "The link works once and expires in %(days)s day."
msgid_plural "The link works once and expires in %(days)s days."
msgstr[0] "Le lien fonctionne une fois et expire dans %(days)s jour."
msgstr[1] "Le lien fonctionne une fois et expire dans %(days)s jours."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/invitation_email.txt:8
msgid "If you did not expect this invitation, ignore this email."
msgstr "Si vous n'attendiez pas cette invitation, ignorez ce message."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/invite.html:4
#: accounts/templates/accounts/invite.html:7
#: accounts/templates/accounts/manage_home.html:22
msgid "Send an invitation"
msgstr "Envoyer une invitation"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/invite.html:8
msgid ""
"The person receives a link by email to set their password. They are an "
"applicant, and see nothing, until you admit them."
msgstr ""
"La personne reçoit par e-mail un lien pour définir son mot de passe. Elle "
"reste candidat·e, et ne voit rien, tant que vous ne l'avez pas admise."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/invite.html:12
msgid "Send the invitation"
msgstr "Envoyer l'invitation"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/lawyer_home.html:4
#: accounts/templates/accounts/lawyer_home.html:9
#: cases/templates/cases/case.html:40
#: cases/templates/cases/closed_cases.html:18
msgid "Your cases"
msgstr "Vos dossiers de recherche"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/lawyer_home.html:13
msgid "waiting for approval"
msgstr "en attente de validation"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/lawyer_home.html:16
msgid "You have no cases yet."
msgstr "Vous n'avez pas encore de dossier de recherche."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/lawyer_home.html:18
#: cases/templates/cases/new_case.html:4 cases/templates/cases/new_case.html:15
msgid "New case"
msgstr "Nouveau dossier de recherche"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/lawyer_home.html:19
#: cases/templates/cases/closed_cases.html:4
#: cases/templates/cases/closed_cases.html:9
msgid "Closed cases"
msgstr "Dossiers de recherche clos"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/lawyer_home.html:20
#: cases/templates/cases/default_margin.html:4
#: cases/templates/cases/default_margin.html:7
msgid "Default margin"
msgstr "Marge par défaut"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/lawyer_home.html:21
#: cases/templates/cases/clip.html:19 keys/templates/keys/key.html:4
#: keys/templates/keys/key.html:15
msgid "Your personal key"
msgstr "Votre clé personnelle"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/lawyer_home.html:22
#: keys/templates/keys/waiting.html:4 keys/templates/keys/waiting.html:7
msgid "Colleagues waiting for the group key"
msgstr "Collègues en attente de la clé commune"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/login.html:4
#: accounts/templates/accounts/login.html:9
#: accounts/templates/accounts/login.html:15
msgid "Log in"
msgstr "Se connecter"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/login.html:10
msgid "For defence lawyers and the admin. Uploading a video needs no account."
msgstr ""
"Pour les avocat·es de la défense et l'administrateur·rice. Envoyer une vidéo "
"ne demande pas de compte."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/login_limited.html:4
#: accounts/templates/accounts/login_limited.html:8
#: clips/templates/clips/rate_limited.html:4
#: clips/templates/clips/rate_limited.html:8
msgid "Too many attempts"
msgstr "Trop de tentatives"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/login_limited.html:9
#: keys/templates/keys/exposure.html:44
msgid "There have been too many attempts to log in. Try again in an hour."
msgstr "Il y a eu trop de tentatives de connexion. Réessayez dans une heure."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/manage_home.html:4
#: accounts/templates/accounts/manage_home.html:7
#: alerts/templates/alerts/raise_limit.html:18
#: cases/templates/cases/case_requests.html:17
msgid "Administration"
msgstr "Administration"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/manage_home.html:9
msgid "Alerts"
msgstr "Alertes"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/manage_home.html:16
msgid "Mark as seen"
msgstr "Marquer comme vue"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/manage_home.html:23
#: cases/templates/cases/case_requests.html:4
#: cases/templates/cases/case_requests.html:7
msgid "Requests for larger cases"
msgstr "Demandes de dépassement des plafonds"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/manage_home.html:25
msgid "Applicants"
msgstr "Candidat·es"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/manage_home.html:34
msgid "Send a new invitation link"
msgstr "Envoyer un nouveau lien d'invitation"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/manage_home.html:41
msgid "No applicants."
msgstr "Aucun·e candidat·e."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/manage_home.html:44
msgid "Lawyers' access"
msgstr "Accès des avocat·es"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/manage_home.html:54
msgid "Suspend access"
msgstr "Suspendre l'accès"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/manage_home.html:59
msgid "Reinstate access"
msgstr "Rétablir l'accès"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/manage_home.html:62
#: accounts/templates/accounts/revoke.html:4
#: accounts/templates/accounts/revoke.html:7
msgid "Revoke access"
msgstr "Révoquer l'accès"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/manage_home.html:63
#: keys/templates/keys/confirm_key.html:16
msgid "Confirm their new key"
msgstr "Confirmer sa nouvelle clé"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/manage_home.html:64
#: alerts/templates/alerts/raise_limit.html:4
#: alerts/templates/alerts/raise_limit.html:7
msgid "Raise an alert limit"
msgstr "Relever un seuil d'alerte"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/manage_home.html:69
msgid "No lawyers yet."
msgstr "Aucun·e avocat·e pour l'instant."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/no_access.html:4
#: accounts/templates/accounts/no_access.html:8
msgid "No access"
msgstr "Accès refusé"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/no_access.html:9
msgid "Your account does not give access to this page."
msgstr "Votre compte ne donne pas accès à cette page."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/recovery_codes.html:4
#: accounts/templates/accounts/recovery_codes.html:7
msgid "Your recovery codes"
msgstr "Vos codes de secours"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/recovery_codes.html:8
msgid ""
"Keep these codes somewhere safe, away from your phone. Each one lets you log "
"in once if you lose the phone. They are shown only now."
msgstr ""
"Gardez ces codes en lieu sûr, loin de votre téléphone. Chacun permet de vous "
"connecter une fois si vous perdez le téléphone. Ils ne sont affichés que "
"maintenant."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/recovery_codes.html:12
msgid "I have saved them: continue"
msgstr "Je les ai enregistrés : continuer"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/revoke.html:9
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(name)s will lose access for good, and their %(cases)s open case will be "
"closed."
msgid_plural ""
"%(name)s will lose access for good, and their %(cases)s open cases will be "
"closed."
msgstr[0] ""
"%(name)s perdra son accès définitivement, et son dossier de recherche ouvert "
"sera clos."
msgstr[1] ""
"%(name)s perdra son accès définitivement, et ses %(cases)s dossiers de "
"recherche ouverts seront clos."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/revoke.html:11
#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s will lose access for good. They have no open cases."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s perdra son accès définitivement. Cette personne n'a aucun dossier "
"de recherche ouvert."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/revoke.html:13
msgid ""
"This can never be undone. Nothing they did is deleted. To suspend their "
"access for a while instead, use suspension."
msgstr ""
"C'est définitif. Rien de ce que la personne a fait n'est effacé. Pour "
"suspendre son accès pour un temps, utilisez plutôt la suspension de l'accès."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/revoke.html:15
msgid ""
"They are the last lawyer holding the group key. Once they are revoked, no "
"one can read what the vault holds: it becomes unreadable for good. Have the "
"group key given to another lawyer first, unless revoking cannot wait."
msgstr ""
"C'est le dernier ou la dernière avocat·e à détenir la clé commune. Une fois "
"son accès révoqué, plus personne ne pourra lire ce que l'archive conserve : "
"cela deviendra illisible pour de bon. Faites d'abord remettre la clé commune "
"à un·e autre avocat·e, sauf si la révocation ne peut pas attendre."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/revoke.html:19
msgid "The address typed does not match."
msgstr "L'adresse saisie ne correspond pas."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/revoke.html:20
#, python-format
msgid "To confirm, type their email address (%(email)s):"
msgstr "Pour confirmer, saisissez son adresse e-mail (%(email)s) :"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/revoke.html:22
msgid "Revoke access for good"
msgstr "Révoquer l'accès définitivement"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/two_factor_setup.html:4
#: accounts/templates/accounts/two_factor_setup.html:7
msgid "Set up two-factor authentication"
msgstr "Activer la double authentification"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/two_factor_setup.html:8
msgid ""
"Every login needs a code from an authenticator app on your phone, as well as "
"your password."
msgstr ""
"Chaque connexion demande, en plus de votre mot de passe, un code d'une "
"application d'authentification sur votre téléphone."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/two_factor_setup.html:9
msgid ""
"Scan this QR code with the app, or type in the key below, then enter the six-"
"digit code the app shows."
msgstr ""
"Scannez ce QR code avec l'application, ou saisissez la clé ci-dessous, puis "
"entrez le code à six chiffres qu'elle affiche."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/two_factor_setup.html:11
msgid "Key:"
msgstr "Clé :"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/two_factor_setup.html:16
#: accounts/templates/accounts/two_factor_verify.html:13
msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "Confirmer"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/two_factor_verify.html:4
#: accounts/templates/accounts/two_factor_verify.html:7
msgid "Two-factor authentication"
msgstr "Double authentification"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/two_factor_verify.html:8
msgid ""
"Enter the six-digit code from your authenticator app, or one of your "
"recovery codes."
msgstr ""
"Saisissez le code à six chiffres de votre application d'authentification, ou "
"l'un de vos codes de secours."

#: accounts/two_factor.py:40
msgid ""
"This six-digit code is not right. Check the time on your phone and try again."
msgstr ""
"Ce code à six chiffres n'est pas valide. Vérifiez l'heure de votre téléphone "
"et réessayez."

#: accounts/two_factor.py:41
msgid "This recovery code is not right, or has been used already."
msgstr "Ce code de secours n'est pas valide, ou a déjà servi."

#: accounts/two_factor.py:42
msgid "Too many wrong codes. Wait a few minutes before trying again."
msgstr "Trop de codes erronés. Attendez quelques minutes avant de réessayer."

#: accounts/two_factor.py:47
msgid "Six-digit code from the app, or recovery code"
msgstr "Code à six chiffres de l'application, ou code de secours"

#: accounts/views.py:25
msgid ""
"Please enter a correct email address and password. The password is case-"
"sensitive."
msgstr ""
"Saisissez une adresse e-mail et un mot de passe valides. Le mot de passe "
"tient compte des majuscules et des minuscules."

#: alerts/models.py:19
msgid "The ingest queue is backed up"
msgstr "La file de préparation est engorgée"

#: alerts/models.py:20
msgid "Many failed logins for one account"
msgstr "Nombreuses connexions échouées pour un même compte"

#: alerts/models.py:21
msgid "Many downloads by one lawyer in a short time"
msgstr "Beaucoup de téléchargements par un·e avocat·e en peu de temps"

#: alerts/models.py:22
msgid "Many cases created by one lawyer in a short time"
msgstr ""
"Beaucoup de dossiers de recherche créés par un·e avocat·e en peu de temps"

#: alerts/models.py:23
msgid "A key grant did not open for the lawyer who received it"
msgstr ""
"Une remise de la clé commune ne s'est pas ouverte pour l'avocat·e qui l'a "
"reçue"

#: alerts/models.py:25
msgid "A rotation of the group key has waited long for enough lawyers"
msgstr ""
"Un renouvellement de la clé commune attend depuis longtemps assez d'avocat·es"

#: alerts/models.py:26
msgid "A rotator did not finish resealing in time"
msgstr "La personne qui renouvelle la clé commune n'a pas terminé à temps"

#: alerts/models.py:27
msgid "A lawyer drawn to check a rotation did not, in time"
msgstr ""
"Un·e avocat·e tiré·e au sort pour vérifier un renouvellement ne l'a pas fait "
"à temps"

#: alerts/models.py:28
msgid "No lawyer could be drawn for a rotation"
msgstr "Aucun·e avocat·e n'a pu être tiré·e au sort pour un renouvellement"

#: alerts/models.py:29
msgid "Two lawyers disagree about a rotation"
msgstr "Deux avocat·es sont en désaccord sur un renouvellement"

#: alerts/models.py:30
msgid "A rotation of the group key failed its checks"
msgstr "Un renouvellement de la clé commune a échoué aux vérifications"

#: alerts/models.py:31
msgid ""
"A rotation attempt was given up: a new request, or its rotator suspended"
msgstr ""
"Une tentative de renouvellement a été abandonnée : une nouvelle demande, ou "
"la suspension de la personne qui renouvelle la clé commune"

#: alerts/models.py:32
msgid ""
"A rotation found items no lawyer could open: see the log for their clips"
msgstr ""
"Un renouvellement a trouvé des éléments qu'aucun·e avocat·e ne peut ouvrir : "
"leurs clips sont dans le journal du serveur"

#: alerts/models.py:50
msgid "Downloads"
msgstr "Téléchargements"

#: alerts/models.py:51
msgid "Cases created"
msgstr "Dossiers de recherche créés"

#: alerts/templates/alerts/raise_limit.html:8
#, python-format
msgid ""
"For %(name)s, for a few days, such as while they work on a large case. "
"Usually you are alerted at %(downloads)s downloads or %(cases)s cases "
"created in a short time. The raise is recorded in the audit log."
msgstr ""
"Pour %(name)s, pendant quelques jours, par exemple pendant un dossier "
"important. D'habitude, vous êtes alerté·e à %(downloads)s téléchargements ou "
"%(cases)s dossiers de recherche créés en peu de temps. Le relèvement est "
"inscrit au journal d'audit."

#: alerts/templates/alerts/raise_limit.html:10
msgid "Raises in force"
msgstr "Relèvements en cours"

#: alerts/templates/alerts/raise_limit.html:11
#, python-format
msgid "%(activity)s: %(limit)s, until %(until)s"
msgstr "%(activity)s : %(limit)s, jusqu'au %(until)s"

#: alerts/templates/alerts/raise_limit.html:16
msgid "Raise the limit"
msgstr "Relever le seuil d'alerte"

#: alerts/views.py:31
msgid "Alert"
msgstr "Alerte"

